1
00:00:00,334 --> 00:00:02,044
Isn't that too close?

2
00:00:02,169 --> 00:00:03,169
You're just friends

3
00:00:04,171 --> 00:00:05,964
Oh, it's Shindecent

4
00:00:06,089 --> 00:00:07,216
Hyesung

5
00:00:07,341 --> 00:00:08,467
Get up, let's get you home

6
00:00:08,592 --> 00:00:09,760
It's okay

7
00:00:09,885 --> 00:00:10,969
I'll call a cab for him

8
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:14,556
Cab is fine

9
00:00:14,681 --> 00:00:15,933
but not my car?

10
00:00:16,934 --> 00:00:17,935
Hyesung doesn't want

11
00:00:19,603 --> 00:00:20,604
to see you

12
00:00:23,232 --> 00:00:24,232
Soobin

13
00:00:25,359 --> 00:00:27,611
Thank you
for taking care of him

14
00:00:27,736 --> 00:00:30,614
but I'm his boyfriend

15
00:00:30,739 --> 00:00:31,739
Bullshit

16
00:00:32,783 --> 00:00:34,159
Hyesung

17
00:00:34,284 --> 00:00:35,661
get up

18
00:00:35,786 --> 00:00:37,186
Come with me
I have something to say

19
00:00:38,288 --> 00:00:39,288
I'm sorry

20
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,210
I'm going with Soobin

21
00:00:56,223 --> 00:00:57,683
Damn it!

22
00:01:03,146 --> 00:01:04,982
It's been ages since I
was on the shooting set

23
00:01:05,107 --> 00:01:06,817
Oh, you're here

24
00:01:06,942 --> 00:01:08,485
-Hello, Hyobum
-Hello

25
00:01:08,610 --> 00:01:09,278
You just got here?

26
00:01:09,403 --> 00:01:11,280
No, I talked to
the director for a bit

27
00:01:11,405 --> 00:01:12,489
Oh, you did?

28
00:01:12,614 --> 00:01:15,784
This is my first drama
I'm a little nervous

29
00:01:15,909 --> 00:01:17,202
Right

30
00:01:17,327 --> 00:01:19,705
Oh, and thank you
Hyobum

31
00:01:19,830 --> 00:01:21,748
For what?

32
00:01:21,873 --> 00:01:24,084
I heard
you recommended me

33
00:01:24,209 --> 00:01:25,877
It's all thanks to you
I'm here

34
00:01:26,003 --> 00:01:27,003
No, no

35
00:01:27,087 --> 00:01:30,132
I thought it'd be fun
to work with you

36
00:01:30,257 --> 00:01:31,383
For real?

37
00:01:31,508 --> 00:01:32,508
Yeah
